# From the post of 2022-01-20 (studies/data/notes/post-faith-in-christ-first-not-science.html), in the author's words.

=== Faith first
--- Faith in Christ first, not in science [title]
overline: A post from the channel
heading: Faith in Christ first, not in science
sub: Rather they should put their faith in Christ first.
hint: Use the arrow keys or swipe to move through the slides. Tap any gold reference to read the verse.

--- Cultural Christians
lead: Many cultural Christians, seeking to justify the faith put their trust in science, and history, in the words and works of men to try to find reason to justify their faith.
p: Rather they should put their faith in Christ first, and see through that faith and the outpouring of Grace from God the Creator, that that is all the evidence needed.

--- Christ crucified
scripture: 1 Corinthians 1:22-24 | mark: But we preach Christ crucified

=== The evidence
--- The evidence of things not seen [title]
heading: The evidence of things not seen
big: Hebrews 11:1
take: All the evidence needed.
read: app:doctrine-salvation | Salvation by grace through faith
